config SHAREDFS
	bool "sharedfs: filesystem with host-resident metadata (Rust)"
	depends on RUST && VIRTIO
	help
	  A filesystem for virtual machines whose metadata is read directly from
	  a shared memory index maintained by the host, and whose mutations and
	  file data travel over a virtqueue. One writer per export.
